  "sentences": [
   "The speakers said the bill would regulate tax advice across tax agents and financial services, make technical corrections and add two deductible gift recipients.",
   "They described a new financial adviser regime starting on 1 July 2014, followed by a transition lasting three years to allow industry to prepare.",
   "The proposed gift recipient additions would cover the Australian Council of Social Service and Make a Mark Australia, as identified in the debate."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The financial adviser exemption under the Tax Agent Services Act 2009 would extend to 30 June 2014, according to the speech.",
   "The speech described corrections to technical issues within the Tax Agent Services Act 2009.",
   "The speaker said gifts to the newly listed organisations could qualify for income tax deductions."
  ],
  "affected": "Tax agents, financial advisers, the two named organisations and taxpayers donating to them are affected.",
